msgid "When ISyCode first opens a folder without a saved choice, it will create an empty .isyroot marker there. This remembers the workspace identity only; it does not grant file access or copy permissions from another workspace. Broad folders such as your home directory, its parents, the temporary directory, or a mount point still ask first, so unrelated projects never share one workspace by accident."
